[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 109.",
    "start": 1.57,
    "end": 4.642,
    "zh": "第109课。",
    "zh_hant": "第109課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "A good idea.",
    "start": 4.692,
    "end": 6.592,
    "zh": "一个好主意。",
    "zh_hant": "一個好主意。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 7.733,
    "end": 11.235,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "What does Jane have with her coffee?",
    "start": 13.356,
    "end": 16.097,
    "zh": "简喝咖啡时吃了什么？",
    "zh_hant": "簡喝咖啡時吃了什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Shall I make some coffee, Jane?",
    "start": 18.439,
    "end": 20.54,
    "zh": "我来煮点咖啡，好吗，简？",
    "zh_hant": "我來煮點咖啡，好嗎，簡？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "That's a good idea, Charlotte.",
    "start": 21.1,
    "end": 23.041,
    "zh": "好主意，夏洛特。",
    "zh_hant": "好主意，夏洛特。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "It's ready.",
    "start": 24.022,
    "end": 24.982,
    "zh": "准备好了。",
    "zh_hant": "準備好了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Do you want any milk?",
    "start": 25.042,
    "end": 26.463,
    "zh": "你要加点牛奶吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你要加點牛奶嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Just a little, please.",
    "start": 27.283,
    "end": 28.924,
    "zh": "请加一点点。",
    "zh_hant": "請加一點點。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "What about some sugar?",
    "start": 29.965,
    "end": 31.485,
    "zh": "加些糖怎么样？",
    "zh_hant": "加些糖怎麼樣？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Two teaspoonfuls?",
    "start": 31.666,
    "end": 33.286,
    "zh": "两茶匙？",
    "zh_hant": "兩茶匙？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "No, less than that.",
    "start": 34.047,
    "end": 36.208,
    "zh": "不，少一点。",
    "zh_hant": "不，少一點。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "One and a half teaspoonfuls, please.",
    "start": 36.508,
    "end": 39.329,
    "zh": "请加一茶匙半。",
    "zh_hant": "請加一茶匙半。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "That's enough for me.",
    "start": 39.149,
    "end": 40.51,
    "zh": "这就够了。",
    "zh_hant": "這就夠了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "That was very nice.",
    "start": 42.011,
    "end": 44.112,
    "zh": "那真不错。",
    "zh_hant": "那真不錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Would you like some more?",
    "start": 44.993,
    "end": 46.574,
    "zh": "你想再来一点吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你想再來一點嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Yes, please.",
    "start": 47.074,
    "end": 48.615,
    "zh": "好的，谢谢。",
    "zh_hant": "好的，謝謝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "I'd like a cigarette, too.",
    "start": 49.216,
    "end": 50.857,
    "zh": "我还想抽支烟。",
    "zh_hant": "我還想抽支菸。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "May I have one?",
    "start": 50.797,
    "end": 52.078,
    "zh": "我可以来一支吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我可以來一支嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Of course.",
    "start": 52.578,
    "end": 53.759,
    "zh": "当然可以。",
    "zh_hant": "當然可以。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "I think there are a few in that box.",
    "start": 53.899,
    "end": 56.0,
    "zh": "我想那个盒子里有几支。",
    "zh_hant": "我想那個盒子裡有幾支。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "I'm afraid it's empty.",
    "start": 57.262,
    "end": 58.843,
    "zh": "恐怕是空的。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕是空的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "What a pity!",
    "start": 59.683,
    "end": 61.004,
    "zh": "真可惜！",
    "zh_hant": "真可惜！"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "It doesn't matter.",
    "start": 61.265,
    "end": 62.505,
    "zh": "没关系。",
    "zh_hant": "沒關係。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "Have a biscuit instead.",
    "start": 62.866,
    "end": 64.507,
    "zh": "那就吃块饼干吧。",
    "zh_hant": "那就吃塊餅乾吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Eat more and smoke less!",
    "start": 64.507,
    "end": 66.348,
    "zh": "多吃点，少抽点！",
    "zh_hant": "多吃點，少抽點！"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "That's very good advice!",
    "start": 67.129,
    "end": 69.05,
    "zh": "这是非常好的建议！",
    "zh_hant": "這是非常好的建議！"
  }
]
